abstract: >-
  Pipeline and models that break a text down into three strata (Record, Enunciation,
  Mediation) following Maurizio Ferraris's New Realism, typing entities as physical,
  ideal or social and labelling each claim with a hermeneutic operator (naturalised,
  revealed, other). Pilot corpus: emergency provisions across in-force constitutions.
